hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16087","He said, Affan narrated to us, Wuhayb narrated to us, he said, Musa ibn Uqbah narrated to me, he said, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman narrated to me, from al-Aqra ibn Habis, that he called the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) from behind the chambers, and said, O Messenger of Allah, and the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) did not answer him. So he said, O Messenger of Allah, verily my praise is adornment, and my blame is disgrace. And the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said, as Abu Salamah narrated, that is Allah, mighty and majestic."
